# Game addresses that core files may still hold (tools/gamelit.sh).
# "<file> <literal> <reason>": file relative to runtime/, one literal of one
# file per line, covering every use of it in that file.
# Every line below is a UG2 (SPEED2.EXE) address that was in a core file when
# the list was made; each moves into a UG2 file or behind runtime/game.h, and
# its line goes with it (a line that matches nothing fails the check).

# enhance.c: which render target a CreateTexture call makes, by its caller
enhance.c 0x005BA097 UG2 road reflection target call site
enhance.c 0x005BA10D UG2 road reflection blur target call site
enhance.c 0x005BA1CD UG2 rear-view mirror target call site
enhance.c 0x005BA549 UG2 environment cube target call site

